.TH BOF2EXE-MODULE 1
.SH NAME
bof2exe module
.SH USAGE
.nf
Describe or document a versioned module manifest

Usage: bof2exe module [OPTIONS] <MANIFEST>

Arguments:
  <MANIFEST>
          

Options:
      \-\-docs
          Emit generated Markdown module documentation instead of TOML metadata

  \-h, \-\-help
          Print help
.fi
